    "description": "This loop walk explores the Portlick Millennium Forest in County Westmeath. The woods are located just north of Athlone next to Lough Ree. There's miles of peaceful woodland trails with views of the lake to enjoy at the western edge. There's lots of woodland birds, spring bluebells and the medieval Portlick Castle to see here as well.You can continue your walking near the forest on theLough Ree Park Walking Trailand theCorlea Trackway.",
